<section class="wrap py-16" data-collision>
  <h2 class="display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)]">A double-booked face is a refund.</h2>
  <p class="section-copy mt-4">
    In Accra and Kumasi, a face sells for about GH₵ 2,400 to 3,200 a month on a secondary
    road, and past GH₵ 8,000 on a prime corridor. Sell the same six months twice and you
    refund one client, pay to reprint and rehang the other, and lose both for the next
    campaign. The fix is not a rule in a group chat. It is a database that will not commit
    the overlap. Drag the amber bar onto the held face, or use the arrow keys.
  </p>

  <p class="mono mt-8 mb-2 text-sm">ACC-001 · Face A · 1 Aug – 31 Jan</p>
  <div
    class="track h-16"
    data-track
  >
    <div
      class="bar-occupied absolute top-3 h-10 w-[32%] px-3 py-2 text-sm"
      style="left: 36%"
      data-booked
    >
      Held
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute top-3 h-10 w-[22%] cursor-grab bg-[#f97316] px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#142f25]"
      data-draft
    >
      New booking
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="collision-error" data-error></p>
  <p class="section-copy mt-6">
    Not a toast, not a warning. The insert fails.
  </p>
</section>
